WEBVTT

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:28.640
What?

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:30.750
A gang that steals D-Wheels?

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:31.750
Yes.

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:34.850
There's been a rash of crimes.

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:42.750
After the WRGP was announced, the demand 
for D-Wheels went up in the black market.

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:48.360
Security is giving reward money 
for information on the gang.

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:49.790
Reward money?

00:01:07.090 --> 00:01:08.080
Jack!

00:01:13.660 --> 00:01:14.840
That was easy.

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:16.250
You won't get away!

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:19.760
To the thieves who steal D-Wheels!

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:23.180
You can't escape from Jack Atlas!

00:01:24.130 --> 00:01:26.140
You flea!

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:27.370
Stop!

00:01:27.370 --> 00:01:28.670
Syd!

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:39.140
You're just a noisy fly!

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:40.110
Damn!

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:44.020
Hey, are you okay?

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:45.840
Why did you protect me?

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:47.160
Pull yourself together!

00:01:49.050 --> 00:01:51.540
Ushio, he's part of the gang-

00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:52.140
Kazama!

00:01:52.140 --> 00:01:54.210
Kazama, hang in there!

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:56.760
You idiot!  What did you do?

00:01:57.950 --> 00:01:59.530
What's going on?

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:23.040
Every time you're hurt, you can become kinder

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:28.570
Stand up and you'll understand strength

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:33.050
Don't look back and keep going

00:02:33.280 --> 00:02:38.880
Both the past and the future 
are connected to the present

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:43.860
There's no need to fear

00:02:44.090 --> 00:02:51.530
I'll keep telling you that you're not alone

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:57.540
The passionate emotions in your heart

00:02:58.270 --> 00:03:03.310
Streak to the infinite future

00:03:03.510 --> 00:03:08.710
Dreams surpass their limits

00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:16.820
And will lead you to a bright place

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:49.390
Proud Chaos King Archfiend

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:53.190
You punk!

00:03:53.190 --> 00:03:56.330
It's your fault that all 
our work went to waste!

00:03:56.330 --> 00:04:01.620
Jack didn't know that he was an 
undercover cop working for Security.

00:04:02.900 --> 00:04:08.390
Even among the Duel Chasers, 
Kazama is a top-class D-Wheeler.

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:14.810
A D-Wheel represents a D-Wheeler's pride, 
so he won't forgive anyone who steals them!

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:21.230
Despite knowing the risks, he infiltrated the 
gang because he wanted to arrest them personally.

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:30.920
A D-Wheeler's pride...

00:04:38.120 --> 00:04:39.690
I'll borrow this.

00:04:39.890 --> 00:04:41.690
Hey!

00:04:41.690 --> 00:04:43.890
What are you planning to 
do with Kazama's card?

00:04:43.890 --> 00:04:45.260
Jack, where are you going?

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:47.470
Are you going after the gang of thieves?

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:49.680
Don't you dare interfere!

00:04:49.980 --> 00:04:51.000
Jack!

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:51.870
Jack!

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:01.080
A gang that steals D-Wheels?

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:02.020
Yeah.

00:05:02.260 --> 00:05:05.390
I heard that they drop off 
their stolen goods around here.

00:05:05.390 --> 00:05:09.450
Why do you want to know the 
location of their hideout?

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:11.520
I have to pay them back.

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:13.090
Pay them back?

00:05:13.090 --> 00:05:14.140
Come here.

00:05:18.100 --> 00:05:19.740
It's your lucky day.

00:05:19.740 --> 00:05:20.560
Thanks.

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:33.680
Something's wrong.

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:36.890
The map says it should be here.

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:43.600
Why are you snooping around?

00:05:43.920 --> 00:05:48.980
It's safer if you mind your 
own business, former King!

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:50.360
I don't care about you small-timers!

00:05:50.920 --> 00:05:53.480
Take me to your boss!

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:56.330
There's no need for that!

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:05.660
Jack!

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:06.920
Jack!

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:08.410
Jack, are you okay?

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:10.760
Where am I?

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:12.800
What were you thinking?

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:16.420
You invaded the gang's territory alone?

00:06:16.420 --> 00:06:19.350
They know what you look like!

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:22.430
Jack, please don't do anything dangerous.

00:06:22.430 --> 00:06:25.270
This is something I have to do.

00:06:25.630 --> 00:06:27.630
It doesn't involve you.

00:06:27.630 --> 00:06:29.630
Yes it does!

00:06:29.630 --> 00:06:32.100
We're all worried about you!

00:06:32.340 --> 00:06:35.910
Jack, you don't know anything.

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:38.390
They're no ordinary gang.

00:06:38.390 --> 00:06:40.750
They're a fearsome criminal organization.

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:43.520
Their boss Syd is especially cruel.

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:47.820
He's squashed many people who 
stood in his way like bugs.

00:06:52.230 --> 00:06:53.520
What about him?

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:56.300
What happened to that guy?

00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:58.850
Oh, you're talking about Kazama.

00:06:58.850 --> 00:07:01.530
Unfortunately, he hasn't 
regained consciousness yet.

00:07:01.530 --> 00:07:06.150
Security is desperately trying to arrest 
him, but they've been unsuccessful.

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:08.570
So what can you do by yourself?

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:11.000
Hey, listen to me!

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:12.070
Let him go.

00:07:12.310 --> 00:07:13.450
But...

00:07:14.420 --> 00:07:15.280
It's fine.

00:07:15.550 --> 00:07:18.980
He needs to get something back.

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:22.990
And he can only get it with his own hands.

00:07:25.490 --> 00:07:26.480
Good.

00:07:27.100 --> 00:07:28.470
That's the last one.

00:07:28.470 --> 00:07:31.240
Let's hurry up and go to the next spot.

00:07:32.860 --> 00:07:33.970
Okay.

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:40.940
You tricked me this afternoon.

00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:42.280
What?

00:07:42.280 --> 00:07:43.790
What do you want?

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:44.940
Don't play dumb!

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:47.680
Take me to their hideout!

00:07:50.330 --> 00:07:51.690
You're lucky.

00:07:51.690 --> 00:07:54.910
Instead of going to them, they came to you.

00:07:57.660 --> 00:08:01.130
You weren't hurt enough?

00:08:01.130 --> 00:08:04.630
I guess we have to completely crush you.

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:23.170
That was easy.

00:08:23.170 --> 00:08:25.280
He's already unconsciousness.

00:08:25.280 --> 00:08:26.380
Let's go.

00:08:31.560 --> 00:08:33.740
Don't come back, idiot!

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:35.130
You're weak!

00:08:47.300 --> 00:08:49.950
It's time to leave this city.

00:08:49.950 --> 00:08:52.280
It can't be helped.

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:57.600
Security's spy almost discovered 
this factory's location.

00:08:57.600 --> 00:08:59.800
It's about time we leave.

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:04.490
What?

00:09:04.650 --> 00:09:06.070
You're done!

00:09:06.070 --> 00:09:07.200
You're...

00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:08.900
Jack Atlas!

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:10.890
How did you find this place?

00:09:10.890 --> 00:09:12.900
You led me here.

00:09:16.510 --> 00:09:18.070
A transmitter!

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:19.880
Was it when...

00:09:21.810 --> 00:09:24.010
You failed, Gus!

00:09:24.010 --> 00:09:25.710
I'm sorry.

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:27.750
How dare you!

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:28.710
This time...

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:30.460
We'll finish you!

00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:33.850
You punk!

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:36.920
It's pointless!

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:40.120
I already informed Security of this location!

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:42.630
You can't escape!

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:47.800
I lose.  I give up.

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:51.200
If Security knows this location, 
there's nothing we can do.

00:09:51.880 --> 00:09:52.840
Stop it!

00:09:52.840 --> 00:09:57.340
Shall we duel until your guests arrive?

00:09:57.340 --> 00:09:58.540
Duel?

00:09:58.540 --> 00:10:01.650
But it won't be any ordinary duel.

00:10:01.890 --> 00:10:04.890
You'll have to duel my way.

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:10.020
What's this?

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:12.040
We're going to duel here.

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:15.970
If you lose life points, 
the conveyor belt moves.

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:20.130
If you run out of life points, 
you'll be turned into a sandwich.

00:10:20.310 --> 00:10:21.200
What?

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:23.240
What will you do?

00:10:23.240 --> 00:10:24.880
I won't force you.

00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:26.900
If you're scared, you don't have to duel...

00:10:27.110 --> 00:10:28.910
...former King.

00:10:29.410 --> 00:10:32.940
Fine!  I accept the duel!

00:10:35.790 --> 00:10:37.060
Okay!

00:10:37.060 --> 00:10:40.110
Neither one can leave until someone loses!

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:44.990
Let's hurry up and start, former King.

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:48.530
Duel!

00:11:04.020 --> 00:11:05.230
Okay!

00:11:05.230 --> 00:11:08.410
Neither one can leave until someone loses!

00:11:08.410 --> 00:11:13.130
Let's hurry up and start, former King.

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:16.750
Duel!

00:11:17.250 --> 00:11:19.230
I go first!  I draw!

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:21.910
I summon Mad Archfiend!

00:11:23.850 --> 00:11:26.660
I set one card and end my turn.

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:28.500
My turn.

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:32.360
I summon Assault Wheel!

00:11:34.740 --> 00:11:36.990
2300 attack points!

00:11:37.230 --> 00:11:38.430
Battle!

00:11:38.430 --> 00:11:41.180
Assault Wheel attacks Mad Archfiend.

00:11:41.180 --> 00:11:46.020
Mad Archfiend switches to defense 
position when it's attacked.

00:11:47.280 --> 00:11:51.190
When Assault Wheel attacks a 
monster in defense position...

00:11:51.190 --> 00:11:55.390
...if it has more attack points than your 
monster's defense points, you take piercing damage!

00:12:01.460 --> 00:12:03.430
You lost a lot of life points.

00:12:10.650 --> 00:12:13.940
How does it feel to be 
one step closer to hell?

00:12:14.180 --> 00:12:17.510
Well done!  Hurry up and 
turn into a sandwich!

00:12:17.830 --> 00:12:22.250
That won't crush my pride as a duelist!

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:24.480
You're all talk.

00:12:24.480 --> 00:12:32.030
When Assault Wheel attacks, its attack 
points become 0 until my next turn's Standby Phase.

00:12:32.030 --> 00:12:35.400
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:40.220
If you don't counterattack soon, you'll die.

00:12:40.220 --> 00:12:42.200
You don't need to tell me!

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:43.490
My turn!

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:49.850
When monsters are only on your field, I can 
Special Summon Vice Dragon from my hand!

00:12:51.350 --> 00:12:55.390
If I use this effect to summon it, its 
attack and defense points are halved.

00:12:55.550 --> 00:12:58.500
Next, I use the spell card Polymerization!

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:02.730
I fuse Big Piece Golem and 
Medium Piece Golem in my hand!

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:03.960
Appear!

00:13:04.530 --> 00:13:06.400
Multiple Piece Golem!

00:13:07.270 --> 00:13:10.900
I Normal Summon Archfiend Interceptor!

00:13:11.340 --> 00:13:12.450
Battle!

00:13:12.450 --> 00:13:14.370
Multiple Piece Golem attacks!

00:13:14.370 --> 00:13:15.970
I won't let you do that!

00:13:15.970 --> 00:13:18.360
The Continuous Trap Nightmare Wheel!

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:28.690
As long as it's on the field, Multiple Piece 
Golem can't attack or change battle position.

00:13:28.690 --> 00:13:34.420
And during each of my Standby Phases, 
you take 500 points of damage.

00:13:34.420 --> 00:13:38.130
In that case, Vice Dragon 
attacks Assault Wheel!

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:41.090
I activate the trap Plunder Decoy!

00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:45.350
When you attack my monster, 
I gain control of one

00:13:45.350 --> 00:13:49.440
of your Level 4-or-below 
monsters that didn't attack!

00:13:49.670 --> 00:13:52.280
I'll take Archfiend Interceptor.

00:13:52.280 --> 00:13:53.240
What?

00:13:59.170 --> 00:14:01.830
This monster's effect is useful.

00:14:01.830 --> 00:14:08.630
As long as I have it, you take 500 
points of damage every time you attack.

00:14:08.630 --> 00:14:11.960
What will you do?  Will you attack or not?

00:14:14.820 --> 00:14:17.970
Thanks for helping me again.

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:21.150
By the way, what happened to that guy?

00:14:21.150 --> 00:14:22.740
Did he die yet?

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:25.690
You punk!

00:14:25.690 --> 00:14:28.680
I won't let you insult him!

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:30.910
Burn him up, Vice Dragon!

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:38.020
You're both idiots.

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:41.550
Take your own monster's effect!

00:14:48.840 --> 00:14:51.540
You're closer to hell.

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:53.540
I can say the same for you!

00:14:57.090 --> 00:14:58.420
You fool.

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:00.940
It's not the same for me.

00:15:01.710 --> 00:15:07.520
On my conveyor belt, there's a 
stopper right in front of the press.

00:15:07.690 --> 00:15:12.050
You're hoping that Security 
arrives before you're crushed!

00:15:12.730 --> 00:15:14.020
I end my turn!

00:15:16.030 --> 00:15:19.400
You actually think Security is coming?

00:15:19.680 --> 00:15:22.400
That's why you're a fool!

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:23.600
What?

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:26.740
What's going on?

00:15:26.740 --> 00:15:30.330
According to Jack's message, 
this is the correct spot.

00:15:30.330 --> 00:15:31.530
Hey!

00:15:32.680 --> 00:15:35.750
It seems a large tanker was docked here.

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:37.010
A tanker?

00:15:37.010 --> 00:15:39.840
Is that the gang's headquarters?

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:43.550
But it's not here.

00:15:48.660 --> 00:15:49.690
What?

00:15:49.690 --> 00:15:54.220
This factory is inside a large tanker?

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:55.500
Yeah.

00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:58.500
Let's enjoy this relaxing cruise.

00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:04.010
Even though the only thing you have 
left is a one-way ticket to hell.

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:08.890
My turn.  I draw!

00:16:08.890 --> 00:16:11.190
Nightmare Wheel's effect!

00:16:11.190 --> 00:16:15.820
During my Standby Phase, you 
take 500 points of damage.

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:26.450
Next, I summon the Tuner 
Monster Cannon Wheel!

00:16:29.330 --> 00:16:30.830
A Tuner?

00:16:31.350 --> 00:16:36.140
Level 2 Cannon Wheel tunes 
Level 4 Archfiend Interceptor!

00:16:36.830 --> 00:16:39.310
The explosion blooms out of season!

00:16:39.310 --> 00:16:42.310
Carve terrifying tracks 
into the card wasteland!

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:43.860
Synchro Summon!

00:16:44.820 --> 00:16:47.540
Roar, Combat Wheel!

00:16:48.950 --> 00:16:56.320
When Cannon Wheel is used to Synchro 
Summon, you take 500 points of damage!

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:09.350
This was fun, Jack.

00:17:09.740 --> 00:17:11.740
But with this, it's goodbye.

00:17:11.740 --> 00:17:12.910
Battle!

00:17:12.910 --> 00:17:15.750
Combat Wheel attacks Vice Dragon!

00:17:17.150 --> 00:17:19.990
I activate the trap Nightmare Archfiends!

00:17:19.990 --> 00:17:23.360
I release Vice Dragon to Special Summon

00:17:23.360 --> 00:17:29.360
three Nightmare Archfiend Tokens 
on your field in attack position!

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:32.770
The attack target is gone.

00:17:32.770 --> 00:17:34.590
The battle is canceled!

00:17:34.590 --> 00:17:37.870
I activate the Continuous Spell Block Dugout!

00:17:38.360 --> 00:17:45.260
If the total Level of my monsters are 
greater than yours, you can't attack!

00:17:45.260 --> 00:17:50.010
Thanks for giving me three 
Level 6 monsters, you fool!

00:17:50.010 --> 00:17:52.190
My turn!

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:55.580
I summon Sinister Sprocket!

00:17:56.170 --> 00:18:01.390
Level 1 Sinister Sprocket tunes 
Level 6 Multiple Piece Golem!

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:03.890
Lend me your power, Kazama!

00:18:04.450 --> 00:18:06.400
The pulse of the new king!

00:18:06.400 --> 00:18:08.710
Come forth from chaos!

00:18:10.900 --> 00:18:12.550
Synchro Summon!

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:15.850
Proud Chaos King Archfiend!

00:18:19.310 --> 00:18:23.750
Since Multiple Piece Golem is gone, 
Nightmare Wheel is destroyed.

00:18:23.750 --> 00:18:25.230
That's not all!

00:18:25.690 --> 00:18:30.240
When Sinister Sprocket is used to summon 
a Dark Attribute Synchro Monster...

00:18:30.240 --> 00:18:35.660
...a faceup spell or trap card 
on the field is destroyed.

00:18:35.660 --> 00:18:38.860
I destroy your Block Dugout!

00:18:40.460 --> 00:18:43.370
Your wall of protection is gone!

00:18:43.950 --> 00:18:46.870
You're a pathetic punk.

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:49.440
I activate Combat Wheel's effect!

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:51.140
I discard one card in my hand.

00:18:51.140 --> 00:18:56.860
Combat Wheel gains half the attack points 
of all the other monsters on my field!

00:18:59.030 --> 00:19:01.480
It has 5500 attack points!

00:19:01.680 --> 00:19:05.930
Due to this effect, you're only 
allowed to attack Combat Wheel.

00:19:05.930 --> 00:19:08.190
There's nothing you can do.

00:19:08.590 --> 00:19:10.710
I won't forgive you!

00:19:10.710 --> 00:19:15.250
You insulted Kazama and 
stole the D-Wheelers' pride!

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:17.430
Battle!

00:19:17.430 --> 00:19:21.190
Chaos King Archfiend attacks Combat Wheel!

00:19:23.140 --> 00:19:26.730
You finally lost your cool, former King.

00:19:26.730 --> 00:19:29.310
You chose to dive into hell!

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:34.850
When Chaos King Archfiend attacks, 
until the end of the Battle Phase...

00:19:34.850 --> 00:19:37.950
...your monster's attack points 
and defense points are switched!

00:19:38.290 --> 00:19:39.950
What?

00:19:40.190 --> 00:19:42.560
Go, Chaos King Archfiend!

00:19:48.770 --> 00:19:49.970
I'm not done!

00:19:50.150 --> 00:19:57.260
When Combat Wheel is destroyed, its effect 
destroys all Nightmare Archfiend Tokens on your field!

00:19:58.210 --> 00:20:05.230
Due to Nightmare Archfiend Token's effect, 
you take 800 points of damage for each one!

00:20:05.230 --> 00:20:06.720
What?

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:20.050
It's fine.

00:20:20.050 --> 00:20:23.760
There's a stopper on my conveyor belt.

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:46.290
You punk!

00:20:46.290 --> 00:20:47.310
You...

00:20:57.300 --> 00:20:58.480
Jack!

00:20:58.480 --> 00:21:00.620
You're late.

00:21:00.620 --> 00:21:01.820
Jack!

00:21:09.640 --> 00:21:10.750
This is...

00:21:11.650 --> 00:21:14.280
Thanks to that, I won.

00:21:14.550 --> 00:21:18.910
I'm surprised that you defeated 
Syd's gang by yourself.

00:21:18.910 --> 00:21:21.660
It means Security is pathetic.

00:21:21.890 --> 00:21:23.390
How dare you!

00:21:23.390 --> 00:21:25.080
Jack...

00:21:25.080 --> 00:21:28.400
When I'm healed, will you 
have a Riding Duel with me?

00:21:28.400 --> 00:21:29.480
Yeah.

00:21:29.720 --> 00:21:33.380
Jack Atlas always accepts.

00:22:09.860 --> 00:22:14.540
The small cliff floats on the Milky Way

00:22:14.540 --> 00:22:19.550
The sights I see are different 
than what I imagined

00:22:19.830 --> 00:22:24.450
Were you able to move on from the past?

00:22:24.450 --> 00:22:29.460
The answer isn't no, but 
there's something missing

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:34.330
The cruel god tests us

00:22:34.630 --> 00:22:41.270
Let's fill the emptiness 
and head to the next stage

00:22:41.270 --> 00:22:45.140
If you ask me "What's our relationship?"

00:22:45.140 --> 00:22:51.010
We're more than friends... 
but that's not quite right

00:22:51.180 --> 00:22:54.930
Bond is the proper word

00:22:54.930 --> 00:23:00.910
As we fight, we understand each other

00:23:00.910 --> 00:23:03.870
"Where are you right now?"  "On Earth"

00:23:03.870 --> 00:23:06.110
Because I'm not an astronaut

00:23:06.110 --> 00:23:10.790
I have no problems when 
I'm below the ozone layer

00:23:11.080 --> 00:23:13.650
"I know, I'm coming right away."

00:23:13.650 --> 00:23:17.120
You want to party until the morning

00:23:17.120 --> 00:23:20.360
At our special place
